<%
let features = [
  {
    icon: '✨',
    text: 'Enhanced AI engine for better attack vectors detection',
  },
  {
    icon: '💻',
    text: 'Wazuh Housekeeping integration to keep the system clean',
  },
  {
    icon: '💸',
    text: 'Syslog cleaning to avoid data retention issues',
  },
  {
    icon: '💥',
    text: 'Database optimization for improved performance',
  },
]
let bugs = [
  'Fixed empty SMS body in SMS alerts',
  'Internal timezone issue to ensure proper timezones in the frontend',
  'Fixed issue with backend worker tools',
]
%>
<div class="d-flex gap-4">
  <div class="col border-2 border-end pe-4">
    <h3 class="fw-bold">EITIx <%= locals.version %> Enterprise Edition:</h3>
    <div>
      <p>
        EITIx is a powerful threat optimization tool that can also provide advanced security
        orchestration and automation capabilities. Developed by EaglesIdea, EITIx is currently available
        in its <%= locals.version %> version, and is designed to help users achieve maximum performance and
        efficiency in high-performance computing environments while also enhancing their security
        posture.
      </p>
      <p>
        EITIx is powered by advanced algorithms and machine learning techniques that allow it to
        analyze and optimize threat usage in real-time. The tool provides users with detailed
        performance metrics, allowing them to identify performance bottlenecks and optimize code to
        achieve maximum efficiency. But beyond that, EITIx also has powerful security orchestration and
        automation capabilities.
      </p>
      <p>
        EITIx can be configured to automatically detect security incidents and respond to them in real-
        time. This can include everything from detecting and mitigating DDoS attacks to responding to
        potential malware infections. EITIx can also automate routine security tasks, freeing up security personnel to
        focus
        on more complex issues.
      </p>
      <p>
        EaglesIdea, the company behind EITIx, has a strong focus on innovation and developing cutting-
        edge software solutions. The company is committed to providing users with the best possible
        software tools to help them achieve their goals.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are interested in learning more about EITIx's security orchestration and automation
        capabilities, you can contact EaglesIdea at info@eaglesidea.com or visit their website at
        www.eaglesidea.com. With its advanced algorithms, real-time performance metrics, and
        powerful security orchestration and automation capabilities, EITIx is poised to become a leading
        tool for enhancing both performance and security in high-performance computing environments.
      </p>
      <p>
        Copyright © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> EaglesIdea Ltd.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <h3 class="mb-3 fw-bold">What's New in v<%= locals.version %>?</h3>
    <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Feature Updates</h5>
    <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 py-2">
      <% for( let i = 0; i < features.length; i++ ) { %>
      <li class="d-flex gap-1">
        <span><%= features[i].icon %></span>
        <span><%= features[i].text %></span>
      </li>
      <% } %>
    </ul>
    <hr>
    <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Bug Fixes</h5>
    <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 py-2">
      <% for( let i = 0; i < bugs.length; i++ ) { %>
      <li class="d-flex gap-1">
        <span>🐛</span>
        <span><%= bugs[i] %></span>
      </li>
      <% } %>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>